<title>USA: Poe &amp; Brown buys Ariz. insurance co.</title>
<headline>Poe &amp; Brown buys Ariz. insurance co.</headline>
<dateline>DAYTONA BEACH, Fla. 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poe &amp; Brown Inc said Tuesday that its Arizona unit has acquired the property and casualty insurance agency of Shanahan, McGrath &amp; Bradley Inc.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed. The acquisition is effective August 1.</p>
<p>The staff of Shanahan, McGrath &amp; Bradley, which is based in Phoenix, will eventually be combined with the Phoenix office of Poe &amp; Brown, the company said.</p>
<p>Poe &amp; Brown is a general insurance agency.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
